{"id":"en_the-year-i-disappeared","title":"The Year I Disappeared","titleEn":"The Year I Disappeared","description":"After three years in a marriage without love, Cecilia walks away once Nathaniel signs the divorce papers without a moment's pause, his heart still fixed on Stella, his first love. Her own mother betrays her, while her mother-in-law pushes her to disappear, and so she does, leaving no trace behind. Those left behind brace for the worst, unaware that Cecilia has started over in secret, holding something Nathaniel never learned. He now searches for her with growing desperation, yet the woman he overlooked is no longer there, and what she kept hidden might bring everything crashing down.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-year-i-disappeared/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-year-i-disappeared/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Regret","Misunderstanding","Contemporary","Second Chance","Billionaire","Love After Marriage"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdokg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-year-i-disappeared_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdokg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-year-i-disappeared_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdokg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-year-i-disappeared_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdokg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-year-i-disappeared_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rum